# Files and directories excluded from the distributed WordPress.org ZIP.
#
# These stay in the repository — they are development and packaging assets — but must not
# ship, because WP Pusher installs the working tree directly and wp.org rejects several of
# them outright (dot-files, application files).
#
# Consumed by the build procedure in docs/BUILD.md. Format matches `wp dist-archive`:
# one path or glob per line, relative to the plugin root.

# Version control and editor state
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github
.claude
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
.editorconfig

# This file, and the build/documentation assets it belongs to
.distignore
docs
PLUGIN-CHECK-NOTES.md
README.md

# Dev tooling. package-lock.json is an orphan — there is no package.json in this repo.
docker-compose.yml
package-lock.json
node_modules

# Dependency manifests and linter config. None of these exist in the tree today; they are
# listed as forward guards, because an enumerated list only excludes what existed the day it
# was written and wp.org rejects all of them.
composer.json
composer.lock
phpcs.xml
phpcs.xml.dist
.phpcs.xml
.phpcs.xml.dist

# Tests
tests

# Build output
dist

# Scratch and logs
test_modal.html
*.log
*.xlsx
